msgid ""
"Silkie is a terminal emulator built on kitty, extending it with pen and touch input, vector "
"graphics, HDR, and presentation feedback. Install Silkie and explore its specifications."
msgstr "Silkie 是基于 kitty 的终端模拟器，扩展了笔和触摸输入、矢量图形、HDR 以及画面呈现反馈。了解安装方法与协议规范。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:5
msgid "A terminal for richer interaction."
msgstr "让终端拥有更丰富的交互。"

