#: docs/silkie/index.rst:20
msgid ""
"Silkie is a terminal emulator for macOS and Linux, built on `kitty "
"<https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/>`_. It extends the terminal with pen and touch input, vector "
"graphics, HDR color, and display timing feedback."
msgstr ""
"Silkie 是适用于 macOS 和 Linux 的终端模拟器，基于 `kitty <https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/>`_ "
"开发。它为终端增添了笔和触摸输入、矢量图形、HDR 色彩以及显示时序反馈。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:24
msgid ""
"Run your shell and terminal applications. Build software that can draw, respond to a stylus, and "
"understand the display it is running on."
msgstr "运行熟悉的 shell 和终端应用，也可以开发能够绘图、响应触控笔，并了解当前显示设备特性的软件。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:29
msgid ""
"`Install Silkie <#install>`_ :doc:`Try the browser demo <browser-demo>` :doc:`Read the "
"specifications <developer-guide>`"
msgstr "`安装 Silkie <#install>`_ :doc:`试用浏览器演示 <browser-demo>` :doc:`阅读协议规范 <developer-guide>`"

