#: docs/silkie/index.rst
msgid "Specifications and documentation"
msgstr "协议规范与文档"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:46
msgid "**03 / Silkie extensions**"
msgstr "**03 / Silkie 扩展**"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:48
msgid "Pen, touch, ink, vectors, color, and timing. :doc:`Explore Silkie's additions <reference>`."
msgstr "笔、触摸、墨迹、矢量图形、色彩与时序。:doc:`了解 Silkie 的扩展 <reference>`。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:53
msgid "**02 / kitty + kitten tools**"
msgstr "**02 / kitty 与 kitten 工具**"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:55
msgid ""
"The terminal emulator Silkie forks, with graphics, keyboard protocols, and tools called kittens. "
"`Read kitty's docs <https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/>`_ and `kitten docs "
"<https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/kittens_intro/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Silkie 是 kitty 终端模拟器的一个分支。kitty 在传统终端协议之上扩展了图形、键盘等协议，并提供称为 kittens 的工具和插件。阅读 `kitty 文档 "
"<https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/>`_ 和 `kitten 工具文档 "
"<https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/kittens_intro/>`_。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:62
msgid "**01 / Terminal foundations**"
msgstr "**01 / 终端基础**"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:64
msgid ""
"The text stream and VT/xterm-style control sequences that kitty extends. :ref:`Read the "
"underlying references <terminal-foundations>`."
msgstr "kitty 所扩展的文本流与 VT/xterm 风格控制序列。:ref:`阅读基础参考资料 <terminal-foundations>`。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:68
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:70
msgid ""
"Silkie adds protocols that applications can discover and use as needed. Support depends on the "
"operating system, input device, display, and compositor; each specification describes its "
"capabilities and limits."
msgstr "应用可以按需探测和使用 Silkie 的扩展协议。实际支持情况取决于操作系统、输入设备、显示器和窗口合成器；各项规范说明了相应的能力与限制。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:75
msgid "Fonts and typography"
msgstr "字体与排版"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:77
msgid ""
"Mix Iosevka's sans-serif and slab-serif faces, select weights from Thin to Heavy, and control "
"slant in either direction. Regional CJK font preferences preserve character widths and the "
"terminal grid. Font files are installed separately; see :doc:`font-protocol` for configuration "
"and escape sequences."
msgstr ""
"混用 Iosevka 的无衬线与板状衬线字体，选择从 Thin 到 Heavy "
"的字重，并控制两个方向的倾斜。按地区设置中日韩字体偏好，同时保持字符宽度和终端网格。字体文件需要单独安装；配置与转义序列见 :doc:`font-protocol`。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:83
msgid "Pen, touch, and gestures"
msgstr "笔、触摸与手势"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:85
msgid ""
"Give applications pressure and tilt information, touch contacts, smooth scrolling, and gesture "
"events. Inspect what a device reports with the :doc:`show_pointer kitten <show-pointer>`."
msgstr "让应用获取压力、倾斜、触摸接触点、平滑滚动和手势事件。使用 :doc:`show_pointer 工具 <show-pointer>` 查看设备上报的信息。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:89
msgid ""
":doc:`Tablet input <tablet-protocol>` · :doc:`Scrolling <scroll-protocol>` · :doc:`Gestures "
"<gesture-protocol>` · :doc:`Haptics <haptic-protocol>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`数位板输入 <tablet-protocol>` · :doc:`滚动 <scroll-protocol>` · :doc:`手势 <gesture-protocol>` · "
":doc:`触觉反馈 <haptic-protocol>`"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:93
msgid "Vector graphics and ink"
msgstr "矢量图形与墨迹"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:95
msgid ""
"Send paths, styled text and scenes for the terminal to render at the displayed size, with session"
" fonts, text measurement, nested window clips and HDR color. Let the terminal draw pen strokes as"
" input arrives, without waiting for each sample to make a round trip to the application."
msgstr "发送路径、带样式的文本和场景，由终端按显示尺寸渲染；支持会话字体、文本测量、嵌套窗口裁剪和 HDR 色彩。笔输入到达时即可由终端绘制笔迹，无须等待每个采样点往返应用。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:100
msgid ""
":doc:`Vector images <vector-protocol>` · :doc:`Terminal-side ink <ink-protocol>` · :doc:`GPU "
"surfaces <gpu-surface-protocol>`"
msgstr ":doc:`矢量图像 <vector-protocol>` · :doc:`终端侧墨迹 <ink-protocol>` · :doc:`GPU 表面 <gpu-surface-protocol>`"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:104
msgid "Color beyond ordinary SDR"
msgstr "超越普通 SDR 的色彩"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:106
msgid ""
"Use wider color spaces and request brightness above SDR white on supported displays. Query the "
"available headroom and control transparency at the cell level."
msgstr "在支持的显示器上使用更宽的色域，以及高于 SDR 白色的亮度。查询可用的亮度余量，并控制单个字符单元的透明度。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:109
msgid ""
":doc:`HDR <hdr-protocol>` · :doc:`Wide gamut <wide-gamut-protocol>` · :doc:`Cell alpha <cell-"
"alpha-protocol>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`HDR <hdr-protocol>` · :doc:`广色域 <wide-gamut-protocol>` · :doc:`字符单元透明度 <cell-alpha-"
"protocol>`"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:113
msgid "Display and presentation feedback"
msgstr "显示信息与画面呈现反馈"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:115
msgid ""
"Learn about the display, receive input timing information, and track when a frame is presented. "
"Use those reports to coordinate drawing with the terminal."
msgstr "了解显示设备、接收输入时序信息，并跟踪画面何时呈现。应用可以利用这些报告与终端协调绘制。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:118
msgid ""
":doc:`Display information <display-protocol>` · :doc:`Latency <latency-protocol>` · :doc:`Frame "
"presentation <frame-protocol>`"
msgstr ":doc:`显示信息 <display-protocol>` · :doc:`延迟 <latency-protocol>` · :doc:`画面呈现 <frame-protocol>`"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:122
msgid "Games"
msgstr "游戏"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:124
msgid ""
"Play **Presidential**, a political satire and economic simulation, or **Silkie Loophole**, a "
"raccoon's trick-or-treating adventure in Montpelier. **Silkie Sprint** crosses roads and rivers; "
"**Silkie Scramble** gathers chicks while outwitting garden predators. All four run in the "
"browser's Linux terminal and support native Silkie and kitty terminals."
msgstr ""
"体验政治讽刺与经济模拟游戏 **Presidential**，或在 **Silkie Loophole** 中扮演浣熊，踏上蒙彼利埃的万圣节讨糖冒险。**Silkie Sprint** "
"带你穿越道路和河流；**Silkie Scramble** 则需要召集小鸡，智取花园里的捕食者。四款游戏均可在浏览器的 Linux 终端中运行，也支持原生 Silkie 和 kitty 终端。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:130
msgid ":doc:`Play the games, watch gameplay, and find installation instructions <games>`."
msgstr ":doc:`试玩游戏、观看实机视频并了解安装方法 <games>`。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:133
msgid "Install"
msgstr "安装"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:135
msgid ""
"Binary packages are available from `Homebrew <https://brew.goblinreactor.com/#silkie>`_ for Apple"
" Silicon macOS, and the `APT repository <https://apt.goblinreactor.com/#silkie>`_ for Linux. See "
":doc:`install` for the supported targets and installation instructions. For automatic package-"
"source setup and installation::"
msgstr ""
"Apple Silicon macOS 用户可从 `Homebrew <https://brew.goblinreactor.com/#silkie>`_ 安装，Linux 用户可使用 `APT"
" 软件仓库 <https://apt.goblinreactor.com/#silkie>`_。支持的平台和安装步骤见 :doc:`install`。也可以自动配置软件源并安装：::"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:142
msgid "The installer asks before adding or changing Goblin Reactor package sources."
msgstr "安装脚本会在添加或修改 Goblin Reactor 软件源之前征求许可。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:144
msgid ""
"To build from source, use the ``silkie`` branch. You will need Git, a C compiler, and Go; Linux "
"also needs the system libraries listed in the :doc:`installation guide <install>`. The build "
"script downloads the remaining build dependencies."
msgstr "从源码构建时，请使用 ``silkie`` 分支。你需要 Git、C 编译器和 Go；Linux 还需要 :doc:`安装指南 <install>` 中列出的系统库。构建脚本会下载其余构建依赖。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:151
msgid ""
"Launch the installed application with ``silkie`` and use ``silkie-kitten`` for its companion "
"tools. The source build above runs directly from the checkout. Upstream kitty packages install "
"upstream kitty; use the Silkie packages or source above to get these additions."
msgstr ""
"安装后，运行 ``silkie`` 启动终端，使用 ``silkie-kitten`` 运行配套工具。上面的源码构建命令直接从检出目录运行开发版本。上游 kitty 软件包安装的是上游 "
"kitty；如需 Silkie 的扩展，请使用上述软件包或源码。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:158
msgid ":doc:`Installation details <install>` :doc:`Configure Silkie <configuration>`"
msgstr ":doc:`安装详情 <install>` :doc:`配置 Silkie <configuration>`"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:162
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:164
msgid ""
"Silkie's specifications describe the additions. Read them alongside the upstream references to "
"understand the terminal as a whole."
msgstr "Silkie 的规范说明其新增功能。理解完整终端行为时，请同时参阅上游参考文档。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:168
msgid "Find the specifications"
msgstr "查找协议规范"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:170
msgid ""
"The developer guide brings together terminal standards, kitty and kitten manuals, Silkie's "
"extension specifications, and links to the source."
msgstr "开发者指南汇集了终端标准、kitty 与 kitten 手册、Silkie 扩展规范和源代码链接。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:173
msgid ":doc:`Developer guide <developer-guide>`"
msgstr ":doc:`开发者指南 <developer-guide>`"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:176
msgid "Use the extension reference"
msgstr "使用扩展参考手册"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:178
msgid ""
"Find escape sequences, fields, units, replies, and platform limits. Start with capability "
"discovery and shared framing, then choose a protocol."
msgstr "查阅转义序列、字段、单位、回复和平台限制。从能力探测与通用消息封装开始，再选择所需协议。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:181
msgid ":doc:`All Silkie specifications <reference>` · :doc:`Capability discovery <capabilities-protocol>`"
msgstr ":doc:`全部 Silkie 规范 <reference>` · :doc:`能力探测 <capabilities-protocol>`"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:185
msgid "Follow the upstream manuals"
msgstr "参阅上游手册"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:187
msgid ""
"kitty documents inherited terminal behavior. Its kittens are tools and plugins that use and "
"extend kitty, such as image display, SSH integration, and remote control."
msgstr "kitty 文档说明 Silkie 继承的终端行为。kittens 是使用并扩展 kitty 的工具和插件，可用于图像显示、SSH 集成和远程控制等任务。"

#: docs/silkie/index.rst:190
msgid ""
"`kitty manual <https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/>`_ · `Kitten tools "
"<https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/kittens_intro/>`_ · `kitty protocols "
