"/protocol-extensions/>`_"


# Installer and Extended-width defaults.
msgid "Binary packages are available from `Homebrew <https://brew.goblinreactor.com/#silkie>`_ for Apple Silicon macOS, and the `APT repository <https://apt.goblinreactor.com/#silkie>`_ for Linux. See :doc:`install` for the supported targets and installation instructions. To set up package sources and install both Silkie and its Iosevka font::"
msgstr "二进制软件包可从面向 Apple Silicon macOS 的 `Homebrew <https://brew.goblinreactor.com/#silkie>`_ 和面向 Linux 的 `APT 仓库 <https://apt.goblinreactor.com/#silkie>`_ 获取。支持的平台与安装说明见 :doc:`install`。以下命令可配置软件源，并同时安装 Silkie 和 Iosevka 字体：::"

# Installer and Extended-width defaults.
msgid "The installer asks before adding or changing Goblin Reactor package sources. It installs unmodified Iosevka with its SIL Open Font License notice. Silkie uses Iosevka's wider Extended faces by default."
msgstr "安装脚本会在添加或修改 Goblin Reactor 软件源之前征求许可，并安装未经修改的 Iosevka 字体及其 SIL 开源字体许可证声明。Silkie 默认使用较宽的 Extended 字形。"
